-model\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d233\"},\"ref\":\"d233\",\"snippet\":\" ... Some are mythical; others are real people like English Richard Lionheart of 1199. It was carved to symbolize the shared history between England and France in the Middle Ages.\\n\\nInside you'll find Richard Lionheart commemorated in the ambulatory around the choir where his heart is buried. There ... \",\"title\":\"https://maryannesfrance.com/things-to-do/attractions/cathedrals-religious-sites/9-great-french-gothic-cathedrals/\"}],\"next_step\":\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue.\",\"observation\":{\"first_delivered_source_round\":null,\"prior_deliveries\":0,\"query_key\":\"254f6479e8d58bc0f957c26e1cfa16a83ebc7e8dfc23e081fcdafbde008b0058\",\"replay_requested\":false,\"result_fingerprint\":\"0beb71cec6597df2aa82e71d34b91587da74db3c41f303c7e929ab178588da89\",\"semantic_progress\":\"not_measured\"},\"query\":\"Richard Harmon height meters\",\"view\":\"full\"},{\"cached\":false,\"hits\":[{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d207\"},\"ref\":\"d207\",\"snippet\":\" ... for the 100, and even instructs Clarke Griffin and Jasper Jordan on how to rig the dropship to \\\"blast off\\\" in the Season One finale.\\n\\nDuring the second season, Raven struggles with nerve damage in her left leg from a gunshot injury she received when John Murphy shot ... \",\"title\":\"https://the100.fandom.com/wiki/Raven_Reyes\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d216\"},\"ref\":\"d216\",\"snippet\":\" ... Here's a look at the family they created.\\n\\nJohn 'Jack' Carter, 77\\n\\nBorn in 1947, the Carters' oldest child, Jack Carter, followed hi