ot.virginia.gov/about/workers-memorial/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d237\"},\"ref\":\"d237\",\"snippet\":\" ... Brown's second book, \\\"The New Testament\\\" (Copper Canyon 2014), won the Anisfield-Wolf Book Award. His third collection, \\\"The Tradition,\\\" was a finalist for the National Book Award and the National Book Critics Circle Award.\\n\\nIn his classes at Emory, Brown encourages his students to \\\"feel free ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.uno.edu/news/2020-08-11/pulitzer-prize-poet-and-alumnus-jericho-brown-what-im-doing-now-still-bears-upon-what-i-learned-uno\"}],\"next_step\":\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue.\",\"observation\":{\"first_delivered_source_round\":null,\"prior_deliveries\":0,\"query_key\":\"1d73fa103c50b0207f8695386f357a96cc45d05e1251da30d13a354d36d3c85c\",\"replay_requested\":false,\"result_fingerprint\":\"2687fdb8dccd3dbe11e72dfc06f1392ee3b212ade1c4693eee29450e848b90a0\",\"semantic_progress\":\"not_measured\"},\"query\":\"Murphy The 100 married Emori child survives\",\"view\":\"full\"}]}","role":"tool","tool_call_id":"call_322b6fc615594a808df668aa"},{"content":"I need to verify the remaining clues. The \"real-life relative plays unrelated character\" fits Richard Harmon (Murphy) and his sister Jessica Harmon (Niylah) on The 100. But I need to verify Murphy's marriages (3-4 times), only one child surviving, and Richard Harmon's height (1.65-1.70m). Let me read the Murphy character page and search for Richard Harmon's height.","role":"assistant","tool_calls":[{"function":{"arguments":"{\"queries\": [\"John Murphy The 100 character wiki marriages Emori\", \"Richard Harmon actor height cm\", \"The 100 Murphy Emori married child baby\"], \"top_k\": 8}","name":"search"},"id":"call_e025170e2a0f4286a86021a3","index":0,"type":"function"}]},{"content":"{\"action_slot_charged\":true,\"executed\":true,\"ok\":true,\"results\":[{\"cached\":false,\"hits\":[{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d207\"},\"ref\":\"d207\",\"snippet\":\" ... for the 100, and even instructs Clarke Griffin and Jasper Jordan on how to rig the dropship to \\\"blast off\\\" in the Season One finale.\\n\\nDuring the second season, Raven struggles with nerve damage in her left leg from a gunshot injury she received when John Murphy shot ... \",\"title\":\"https://the100.fandom.com/wiki/Raven_Reyes\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d238\"},\"ref\":\"d238\",\"snippet\":\" ... and wiki before posting.\\n\\nFrom MBA to Fortune 500 (US) CEO\\n\\nI was always wondering what % of CEOs have MBA degrees and after a lot of hours and a lot of google and LinkedIn search over a few weeks, I have compiled the following for the 2021 Fortune ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.reddit.com/r/MBA/comments/u26w7r/from_mba_to_fortune_500_us_ceo/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d218\"},\"ref\":\"d218\",\"snippet\":\" ... Foster entered the Congregation of Holy Cross in 1989 and was ordained to the priesthood in 1995. He also completed a Clinical Ethics Fellowship at the University of Chicago School of Medicine in 1997.\\n\\nNicole Stelle Garnett, John P. Murphy Foundation Professor of Law\\n\\nPNicole Stelle Garnett's ... \",\"title\":\"https://ethicscenter.nd.edu/people/advisory/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d239\"},\"ref\":\"d239\",\"snippet\":\" ... Before 1926, birth, marriage, and death information can be found in church records. (Source: FS Wi